# MajorTom environment configuration.
#
# MajorTom needs NO credentials to run. The demo and the entire test suite work
# offline with none of these set. Copy to `.env` only if you wire up an integration.

# --- GitHub (NOT IMPLEMENTED — see ROADMAP.md section 2) ---
# A fine-grained PAT scoped to a single demo repository: contents RW, pull
# requests RW. Never commit a real token; never place one in source or logs.
# GITHUB_TOKEN=

# --- OSV.dev (NOT IMPLEMENTED) ---
# The OSV API is public and needs no key. A cached fixture is the intended
# offline fallback for demos.
# OSV_API_URL=https://api.osv.dev/v1/query
